        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=3$",
          "worked": "By the external-secant form of the Power of a Point Theorem,\n$$\\begin{align*}x(x+9)&=4(4+5)\\\\x^2+9x&=36\\\\x^2+9x-36&=0\\\\(x+12)(x-3)&=0\\\\x&=3.\\end{align*}$$\nReject $x=-12$ since a length is positive.",
